# Skeleton: actions read from one wrapping 10-wide strip (idle 0-7, walk 10-19, attack/scythe 40-44, death/collapse 50-59); alert and rise frames left unimported.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet skeleton.ppm
cell 64 64

bank SKELETON
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-7
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 10-19
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 40-44
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 50-59
